{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "作为哥哥，至少在周日得让樱乃好好睡上一觉。\\n如此想着，我独自一人向社团活动室走去。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": "作为哥哥，至少在周日得让樱乃好好睡上一觉。如此想着，我独自一人向社团活动室走去。", "plain_idx": 225, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "睡眠不足对女孩子来说可是大问题。", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然看她在我房间里睡得正香的样子，\\n我这担心应该是多余的了。", "text_idx": 227, "plain": "虽然看她在我房间里睡得正香的样子，我这担心应该是多余的了。", "plain_idx": 228, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她跑到我房间里看书，\\n结果看着看着就躺在床上睡着了。", "text_idx": 229, "plain": "她跑到我房间里看书，结果看着看着就躺在床上睡着了。", "plain_idx": 230, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这季节也确实容易让人犯困。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃？！」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0827", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……早上好，乾同学」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一看到我，她就发出了一声非常不礼貌的叫声。我则简短地向她打了个招呼。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她冲我摆出一副极度厌恶的表情。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一大早就这么晦气」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0828", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毁了你的雅致真是抱歉」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且我不是说过今天休息吗？\\n　怎么还干劲满满地往活动室走啊」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": "「而且我不是说过今天休息吗？　怎么还干劲满满地往活动室走啊」", "plain_idx": 242, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0829", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我老是有点在意那些小动物们。\\n　而且今天美羽学姐不是还要打工么」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": "「我老是有点在意那些小动物们。　而且今天美羽学姐不是还要打工么」", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐下次才去打工。\\n　亏我还想跟学姐两个人亲热一个上午呢」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "「学姐下次才去打工。　亏我还想跟学姐两个人亲热一个上午呢」", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0830", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我打乱她计划所以惹她不高兴了吗。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……算了，乾同学不高兴倒也不稀奇。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，我们能像这样两个人并肩走在一起，\\n也算是关系好了一点吧。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": "不过，我们能像这样两个人并肩走在一起，也算是关系好了一点吧。", "plain_idx": 252, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且今天……」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0831", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？今天是有什么事吗？」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0832", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天要把两只松鼠送归大自然。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们社团的活动目的并不是饲养动物。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那些被照料好的动物，\\n只要身体健康，就会被送回原来的栖息地。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": "那些被照料好的动物，只要身体健康，就会被送回原来的栖息地。", "plain_idx": 261, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不好意思呀，把你们关在小笼子里这么久」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0773", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「记得之后就不要再回到这里了哦……」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0774", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当时，这两只小松鼠受了伤，在马路上蜷缩着。\\n学姐发现后把它们救了下来。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "当时，这两只小松鼠受了伤，在马路上蜷缩着。学姐发现后把它们救了下来。", "plain_idx": 268, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "据说它们的父母死在了一旁。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今后，这两只小松鼠将会面对严峻的大自然生活。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不会再有谁来帮助它们。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，那里却有着无限的自由。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0833", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐笑着目送两只松鼠离去，\\n与之形成对比的是乾同学那拼命忍住泪水的样子。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": "美羽学姐笑着目送两只松鼠离去，与之形成对比的是乾同学那拼命忍住泪水的样子。", "plain_idx": 276, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她经常照顾这两只松鼠，\\n松鼠们也都很喜欢她。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": "她经常照顾这两只松鼠，松鼠们也都很喜欢她。", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「乾同学，用这个吧」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我刚递出手帕，乾同学就快速地转过身去。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": "我刚递出手帕，乾同学就快速地转过身去。", "plain_idx": 280, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后头也不回地就接过了我的手帕。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，回去吧」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0775", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那两只松鼠并没有名字。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不给动物起名字是美羽学姐决定的，\\n这是为了不让我们对它们投入过多的情感。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": "不给动物起名字是美羽学姐决定的，这是为了不让我们对它们投入过多的情感。", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「快滚远点啊，混蛋……」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0834", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学背着身，\\n头也不回一下，以她独有的方式跟松鼠告别。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": "乾同学背着身，头也不回一下，以她独有的方式跟松鼠告别。", "plain_idx": 290, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是乎，两只松鼠竞相奔跑起来，\\n消失在了森林之中。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": "于是乎，两只松鼠竞相奔跑起来，消失在了森林之中。", "plain_idx": 292, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学的肩膀颤抖个不停。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她们俩一定经历过数次与动物们的分别了吧。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": "她们俩一定经历过数次与动物们的分别了吧。", "plain_idx": 294, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐并没有安慰乾同学。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是轻轻地抚摸她的头。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……学姐，你不会感到不舍吗？」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然啦，很不舍——」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0776", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐的笑容没有一丝变化。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过我想，那两个小家伙一定更加想念大自然吧」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0777", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐用温柔的眼神看向松鼠隐去身影的树林。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们不会得到称赞。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "动物们也不会像童话或传说中的那样前来报恩。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": "动物们也不会像童话或传说中的那样前来报恩。", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尽管如此，学姐仍挺直这自己小小的身板，\\n注视着那片树林。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": "尽管如此，学姐仍挺直这自己小小的身板，注视着那片树林。", "plain_idx": 307, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜哇，这谁的手帕？」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0835", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我的……这可是你刚才自己拿走的啊？」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……完全没这印象」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0836", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她刚才，应该脑子里想的都是松鼠吧。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这该不会是上完厕所洗完手用的吧」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0837", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「放心，没用过」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这人上完厕所不洗手的？！」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0838", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有没有，我不是那个意思。\\n　只是我今天还没有去过厕所」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": "「没有没有，我不是那个意思。　只是我今天还没有去过厕所」", "plain_idx": 320, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看你这样子，身上肯定一身的病菌。\\n　这手帕还是消消毒比较好」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": "「看你这样子，身上肯定一身的病菌。　这手帕还是消消毒比较好」", "plain_idx": 322, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0839", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说着，乾同学就把我的手帕放到了她的小包中。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": "说着，乾同学就把我的手帕放到了她的小包中。", "plain_idx": 324, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我说，我的手帕……」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「消完毒再还你」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0840", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉啊。我也想借给你的，\\n　但之前去洗手间用过了……」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": "「抱歉啊。我也想借给你的，　但之前去洗手间用过了……」", "plain_idx": 329, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0778", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么？！\\n　呃呃呃——美羽学姐原汁原味的手帕！好想要呃呃呃」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": "「什么？！　呃呃呃——美羽学姐原汁原味的手帕！好想要呃呃呃」", "plain_idx": 332, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0841", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "啥啊，原汁原味是什么意思……", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～？」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0307", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「带着美羽学姐原汁原味的手帕，熊喵你也想要对吧！\\n　简称美羽汁……啊，多么美妙的音调」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": "「带着美羽学姐原汁原味的手帕，熊喵你也想要对吧！　简称美羽汁……啊，多么美妙的音调」", "plain_idx": 340, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0842", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总感觉这简称奇奇怪怪的。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿咻，得把这个笼子也清理干净」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0779", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，这种杂活就交给小的吧」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0843", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂，瓜生，你也别在那发呆」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0844", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学看着没有松鼠的笼子，\\n强行让自己打起精神来。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": "乾同学看着没有松鼠的笼子，强行让自己打起精神来。", "plain_idx": 350, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这想必是她掩盖负面情绪的方式吧。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这里的动物们，总有一天都会离开的吧」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，为此我也必须要加把劲呢」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0780", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "养的动物们不在了会很不舍。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，那并不是件悲伤的事。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽有不舍，但将它们送归自然一定是一件很美好的事情。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生，我要关门了，快点出来——」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0845", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，抱歉抱歉，我在给樱乃发短信」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「出来之后再发啊，快点，我要锁门了」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0846", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我就像个欠房租的租客一样被她赶了出去。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃发来的短信没有标题，只有正文。", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我被蒙骗了，哥哥」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5164", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我没有叫醒樱乃就独自出了门，\\n她好像对此相当生气。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": "我没有叫醒樱乃就独自出了门，她好像对此相当生气。", "plain_idx": 369, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "先给她回个信吧。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃最近好像受了些安洁的影响，\\n她本身又处在感性敏感的时期，身为哥哥我很是担心。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": "樱乃最近好像受了些安洁的影响，她本身又处在感性敏感的时期，身为哥哥我很是担心。", "plain_idx": 372, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她万一受了乾同学的影响……", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『我家老哥真的超烦人的啦』", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1205", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后在房间里看漫画的时候，\\n给我突然来上那么一脚飞踢。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": "然后在房间里看漫画的时候，给我突然来上那么一脚飞踢。", "plain_idx": 377, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……如果有的选，我倒是想让她受到点美羽学姐的影响啊。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……为什么我会和你这家伙一起放学回家啊」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": "「唉……为什么我会和你这家伙一起放学回家啊」", "plain_idx": 379, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0847", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为美羽学姐去打工了，\\n所以留在活动室里的就剩我们两个。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": "因为美羽学姐去打工了，所以留在活动室里的就剩我们两个。", "plain_idx": 382, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且刚才出校门的时候，还被安洁调侃了一下，\\n估计这也是她不高兴的原因之一吧。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": "而且刚才出校门的时候，还被安洁调侃了一下，估计这也是她不高兴的原因之一吧。", "plain_idx": 384, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "更何况当时安洁还满脸笑容——", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——来了句“真是对形影不离的夫妻呢”。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……对了，你的手好了吗？」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0848", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？手？」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你手之前不是烧伤了么」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0849", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，已经没事了。本身也不怎么严重」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0850", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最近发生了很多事呢」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你进社团之前可什么事都没有」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0851", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，确实。我不在的话，\\n　乾同学应该也不会在活动室里使用飞踢了」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": "「啊哈哈，确实。我不在的话，　乾同学应该也不会在活动室里使用飞踢了」", "plain_idx": 398, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那种事情我不会再做了」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0852", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学一脚把脚下的石头踢飞，\\n嘟起嘴，腮帮子一下子变得鼓鼓的。", "text_idx": 401, "plain": "乾同学一脚把脚下的石头踢飞，嘟起嘴，腮帮子一下子变得鼓鼓的。", "plain_idx": 402, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我们并排走着，\\n不过一直保持着一定的距离。", "text_idx": 403, "plain": "虽然我们并排走着，不过一直保持着一定的距离。", "plain_idx": 404, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我丑话说在前头，\\n　我可没有认可你是社员」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": "「我丑话说在前头，　我可没有认可你是社员」", "plain_idx": 406, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0853", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我要怎么做才能得到认可呢？」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要么你变成女的，要么你再也别进入到美羽学姐半径10米以内」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": "「要么你变成女的，要么你再也别进入到美羽学姐半径10米以内」", "plain_idx": 409, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0854", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "两个要求都挺刁难人的啊。", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要是你做不到……」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0855", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜哇？！」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她突然将手中的手提包抡了一圈。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就尽全力来让我认可你吧，笨蛋！」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0856", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同学向我吐了下舌头，然后小跑着离开了。", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "连和她说声再见的机会都没给我。", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即便如此，跟以前相比，\\n说不定也算是向前迈出了一小步吧。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": "即便如此，跟以前相比，说不定也算是向前迈出了一小步吧。", "plain_idx": 421, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦，樱乃发来的么」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大概是先前短信的回信吧。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还是老样子，没有写上短信标题。", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_psp_route01_2_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不禁抱头苦恼起来……", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
